WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.901
-All right, everyone, it's time
for "Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.000
Here we go.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.667
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.300
♪♪

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.667
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.834
♪♪

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.200
-Now, we do this thing
every week

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.534
where I send out a hashtag,

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:17.801
and we ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:21.234
And since we're celebrating
"Nana" Week this week...

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:22.667
Yeah.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.133
I sent out the hashtag
"NanaQuotes,"

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:29.300
and I asked you to share
some of the funniest things

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.968
that your nanas have said.

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.901
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic,

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:37.467
number-one trending topic,
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:40.601
A lot of people have love
for the grandma, for the nana.

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:43.701
This first one's
from @brendanburkeNRT.

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:44.701
He says...

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.167
He's like, "No."
[ Applause ]

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.834
This one's from @annielynne2002.
She says...

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:04.934
-Yeah, like,
"Hey, squeeze the bottle."

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:06.234
[ Chuckles ] That's a good line.

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:10.701
This one's from @H2Obirth.
She says...

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:20.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:22.067
[ Groovy music plays ]

00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:27.334
This next one's
from @hammerheadhope.

00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:29.334
[ Crowd chuckles ]

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:30.334
She says...

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:38.100
Yeah, that's how they cheat you
out of the water --

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:41.033
they put extra frozen water
in there.

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:44.167
This one's from @brittb412.
She says...

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:55.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.234
That's funny.
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:57.234 --> 00:02:01.367
-She would haunt them.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:04.000
Not hurt them,
she's gonna haunt them.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.868
That's genius.

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:10.133
This one's from @mmiller215.
She says...

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:18.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.667
It's a thinker.
-Yeah.

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:22.767
-It's really funny,
though, yeah.

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:25.367
How am I doing? Well,
let's just say this much --

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:26.601
I ain't buying
any green bananas,

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:27.701
you know what I'm saying?

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:29.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:33.434
This one's from @Kevin44274458.

00:02:33.434 --> 00:02:36.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:37.400
-What is it?

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.167
-He's like, "How come
no one's following me?"

00:02:39.167 --> 00:02:40.934
Uh...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:43.701
I have no idea.

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:45.167
Maybe it's
his Social Security number?

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:46.767
I have no idea.
-Yeah.

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:48.100
-People don't care anymore.
-Bank number.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.100
-People have gone a little mad.
-Yeah.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.934
-He says...

00:02:57.234 --> 00:03:00.501
[ Laughs ]

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:03.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:03.767 --> 00:03:06.133
Pecky. Oh, that's funny.

00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:08.667
Sounds nothing like Pablo.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:08.667 --> 00:03:11.734
"Oh, give it to Pecky
over there," like, what?

00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:15.834
This last one from
@AKperezidents. They said...

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.501
There you have it.

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:25.434
Those are our
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:26.834
To check out more
of our favorites,

00:03:26.834 --> 00:03:29.634
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

